# FaceFusion personal fork

This is a **personal fork** of FaceFusion v3.6.0 (upstream at v3.8.2), not vanilla upstream.

## Read first

- `AGENTS.md` — cross-agent entrypoint
- `WORKLOG.md` — live state and next actions
- `settings.md` — config-of-record
- `docs/architecture.md` — pipeline and directory map

## Runtime

Use conda env `facefusion`. Invoke Python as:

```bash
/opt/anaconda3/envs/facefusion/bin/python facefusion.py ...
```

Never bare `python`.

## Fork patches — preserve unless explicitly asked

- Subprocess chunking (`chunk_runner.py`, `chunk-run` CLI)
- Per-frame skip/retry in `image_to_video.py`
- UI subprocess decoupling (`uis/ui_subprocess.py`)
- NSFW gate disabled in `content_analyser.py`
- Diagnostic probes in `exit_helper.py`

## Safety

- Ask before killing renders or clearing `.temp/` frames mid-recovery
- Target/output extensions must match
- No force-push; push only to writable `origin`, never `upstream`
- Update `WORKLOG.md` when shipping meaningful changes
